{"user": "I thought I had to trap the other color between 2 of my own. G2 would mean that the line of white discs ends at A8, it's not trapped by a black disc. Is this allowed?", "user_ts": "2026-08-05T15:01:47.596285+00:00", "assistant": "Yes, **g2 is allowed**.\n\nYou only need to trap White discs in **one straight direction**, not every direction.\n\nIf Black plays **g2**:\n\n- Left along row 2: **f2 is White**, then **e2 is Black** \u2192 so **f2 flips**.\n- Down the g-file: **g3, g4, g5, g6 are White**, then **g7 is Black** \u2192 those flip too.\n\nThe diagonal toward **a8** doesn\u2019t matter unless it forms a valid trapped line; a move can be legal because of any one valid line.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-05T15:01:51.665956+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-05T15:01:53.587480+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Common Ground Question": 1, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 2}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Common Ground Question": 0.3333333333333333, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Common Ground Question"], "llama": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant": {"final": ["Direct Instruction", "Positive Feedback"], "consensus": ["Direct Instruction", "Positive Feedback"], "votes": {"Direct Instruction": 3, "Positive Feedback": 2}, "confidence": {"Direct Instruction": 1.0, "Positive Feedback": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Direct Instruction", "Positive Feedback"], "llama": ["Direct Instruction"], "sonnet": ["Direct Instruction", "Positive Feedback"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assist